        "text": "According to David I. Goldberg (Petitioner), according to David I. Goldberg (Petitioner), arizona law defines the cognitive elements of first-degree murder as requiring proof beyond a reasonable doubt that the defendant intentionally and knowingly shot and killed a police officer."
